Date dimension. Granularity attribute definitions:
Day of Year = ordinal day in year, 1–366; Hour of Day = hour of day, 0–23;
Minute of Hour = minute within hour, 0–59; Week/Year = week number in year;
Day of Month = day of month, 1–31; Week of Year = week of year, 1–53.

